{"id":"84JXgG9Ic9QCAX67","meta":{"instanceId":"9d2f265a730ada39f849fc5d655b942a4e19b4b0394aad81008c6557f8a9d722","templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"name":"Generate LinkedIn posts or WordPress blogs with AI thumbnails and one-click publishing","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"8ab9e949-df5a-43a3-87b4-efef70d2e65d","name":"Sticky Note - Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1664,656],"parameters":{"width":460,"height":1032,"content":"## 🎨 AI Content Studio — generate, preview & one-click publish\n\n### How it works\nAnyone with the form link picks a format (LinkedIn post or WordPress blog), topic categories, tone, and either describes a topic or lets AI pick a trending one. GPT-4o writes the content and an image prompt; gpt-image-1 generates the thumbnail. The draft is saved to Google Sheets (text) and Drive (image), then shown as a styled preview on the ending page with a publish button. LinkedIn posts publish immediately with the image; WordPress blogs are created as a draft with the thumbnail set as featured image — so you get a final review inside WordPress. Every draft is status-tracked: pressing the button twice never duplicates. Nothing is published without that click.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect OpenAI ('Write the Content' + 'Create Thumbnail Image').\n2. Create a Google Sheet with headers: contentId, format, title, bodyPlain, bodyHtml, hashtags, driveFileId, status, createdAt. Connect Google Sheets + Drive and select the sheet in the three Sheets nodes.\n3. Connect LinkedIn (set your person ID in 'Post to LinkedIn') and WordPress credentials; put your site URL in '⚙️ Publish Configuration'.\n4. Copy the PRODUCTION URL from the 'Publish Button Clicked' webhook into 'publishWebhookUrl' in '⚙️ Workflow Configuration'.\n5. Activate and share the form URL.\n\n### Customization\nEdit tones/categories in the form trigger, change thumbnail size (1024x1024, 1536x1024, 1024x1536), or switch WordPress drafts to instant publishing by changing 'draft' to 'publish'. Anyone with a preview link can press its button — don't share previews publicly."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"47afa246-ef47-4145-a93c-5debec718eec","name":"Sticky Note - Input","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1152,784],"parameters":{"color":"#FFFFFF","width":460,"height":400,"content":"## 1. Content brief\nThe form collects format, categories, topic (or 'let AI choose'), tone, and thumbnail preferences. The configuration node holds defaults, the publish webhook URL, and a unique draft ID."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"de0c464a-e4b2-458e-baca-25b289f71bdd","name":"Sticky Note - AI","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-672,784],"parameters":{"color":"#FFFFFF","width":696,"height":400,"content":"## 2. AI generation\nOne structured GPT-4o call writes the post AND a thumbnail prompt as JSON. gpt-image-1 renders the image, converted to base64 for the preview."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"27ad3349-c1c8-40a2-a928-26f4eb0fa290","name":"Sticky Note - Preview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[48,784],"parameters":{"color":"#FFFFFF","width":980,"height":400,"content":"## 3. Save & preview\nDraft text goes to Google Sheets, the thumbnail to Drive. The ending page shows the styled preview with a publish button (label adapts to the chosen format). Keep the last node a Form Ending — custom HTML is sanitized, no scripts."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ec526d29-e78a-4d1f-ab18-0152d92866a0","name":"Sticky Note - Publish","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1136,1232],"parameters":{"color":"#FFFFFF","width":2168,"height":632,"content":"## 4. One-click publish\nThe preview's button calls this webhook with the draft ID. LinkedIn posts publish immediately with the image; WordPress blogs become a draft with featured image (via the REST API, since the native node can't upload media). Duplicate clicks safely show 'already processed'."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"508f77ef-e412-40b4-b1b7-2baaec356b6f","name":"Sticky Note - Warning","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1136,1920],"parameters":{"color":3,"width":320,"height":208,"content":"## ⚠️ Paste the webhook URL\nCopy this node's PRODUCTION URL and paste it into 'publishWebhookUrl' inside ⚙️ Workflow Configuration — otherwise the publish button won't work."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2ea0e3b2-0df3-48e4-b554-3dad2e5d6d45","name":"Content Request Form","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","position":[-1072,992],"webhookId":"1b5622d4-1e13-4960-9759-93c20a1ee9fb","parameters":{"options":{},"formTitle":"AI Content Studio","formFields":{"values":[{"fieldType":"dropdown","fieldLabel":"Content format","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"LinkedIn post"},{"option":"WordPress blog post"}]},"requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"dropdown","fieldLabel":"Topic categories","multiselect":true,"fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"Business & Entrepreneurship"},{"option":"Marketing & Sales"},{"option":"Technology & AI"},{"option":"Finance & Investing"},{"option":"Health & Wellness"},{"option":"Leadership & Careers"}]},"requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"radio","fieldLabel":"Topic source","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"I'll describe it myself"},{"option":"Let AI pick a trending topic"}]},"requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"textarea","fieldLabel":"Topic description","placeholder":"Describe your topic here (leave empty if AI picks the topic)"},{"fieldType":"dropdown","fieldLabel":"Tone","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"Professional"},{"option":"Conversational"},{"option":"Inspirational"},{"option":"Educational"},{"option":"Witty"},{"option":"Bold & opinionated"}]},"requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"radio","fieldLabel":"Thumbnail source","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"I'll give instructions"},{"option":"Let AI design it from the content"}]},"requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"textarea","fieldLabel":"Thumbnail instructions","placeholder":"e.g. minimalist illustration, blue tones, laptop on desk (leave empty if AI designs it)"}]},"formDescription":"Generate a LinkedIn post or WordPress blog with a matching AI thumbnail. You'll see an instant preview — nothing is published until you approve it."},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"163c453f-ad8a-4e23-9b15-d1c33adff67a","name":"⚙️ Workflow Configuration","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[-880,992],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"cfg-image-size","name":"imageSize","type":"string","value":"1536x1024"},{"id":"cfg-brand-notes","name":"brandStyleNotes","type":"string","value":"none"},{"id":"cfg-publish-url","name":"publishWebhookUrl","type":"string","value":"https://YOUR_DOMAIN/webhook/content-studio-publish"},{"id":"cfg-content-id","name":"contentId","type":"string","value":"={{ $execution.id }}-{{ Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 10) }}"},{"id":"77e097f5-2f20-4aa5-800e-bc4027463c76","name":"google_spreadsheet_id","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"e238b4da-9c40-4c79-b854-d9c39f2dd217","name":"google_sheet_name","type":"string","value":"posts"},{"id":"2d8a120b-9c85-439d-b604-1f04f00bc06a","name":"drive_parent_folder_id","type":"string","value":""}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"0c55c429-1590-40c1-9c16-9667d671cb84","name":"Write the Content","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[-624,992],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O-MINI"},"options":{},"messages":{"values":[{"content":"=You are an expert content writer for busy business owners.\n\nINPUTS\n- Format: {{ $json['Content format'] }}\n- Topic categories: {{ Array.isArray($json['Topic categories']) ? $json['Topic categories'].join(', ') : $json['Topic categories'] }}\n- Topic source: {{ $json['Topic source'] }}\n- User topic description: {{ $json['Topic description'] || 'none provided' }}\n- Tone: {{ $json['Tone'] }}\n- Thumbnail source: {{ $json['Thumbnail source'] }}\n- Thumbnail instructions: {{ $json['Thumbnail instructions'] || 'none provided' }}\n- Brand style notes: {{ $json.brandStyleNotes }}\n\nRULES\n1. If the topic source says the AI should pick, choose ONE specific, timely, widely discussed topic within the given categories and use it. Otherwise use the user's topic description.\n2. If Format is 'LinkedIn post': write 150-300 words, strong hook in the first line, short scannable paragraphs, end with a question or call to action, and provide 3-5 relevant hashtags.\n3. If Format is 'WordPress blog post': write 600-900 words with an SEO-friendly structure using H2/H3 subheadings, a compelling introduction and a clear conclusion. Hashtags can be a short list of SEO keywords instead.\n4. Match the requested tone exactly throughout.\n5. Write an image-generation prompt for a thumbnail: professional, 16:9 composition, absolutely no text or lettering in the image. If thumbnail instructions were provided, follow them closely; otherwise derive the visual concept from the content itself.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with exactly these keys and nothing else:\n{\"chosenTopic\": \"the final topic used\", \"title\": \"headline/title\", \"bodyHtml\": \"the body formatted as simple HTML using only <p>, <h2>, <h3>, <strong> tags\", \"bodyPlain\": \"copy-paste ready plain text version with line breaks\", \"hashtags\": \"space-separated hashtags or keyword list\", \"thumbnailPrompt\": \"the image generation prompt\"}"}]},"jsonOutput":true},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"lkBLOrhTZDb2Xq7g","name":"OpenAI account"}},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"73c660dd-4760-4f02-af52-84cd6a5f9bcf","name":"Create Thumbnail Image","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[-336,992],"parameters":{"model":"gpt-image-1","prompt":"={{ $json.message.content.thumbnailPrompt }}","options":{"size":"={{ $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.imageSize }}"},"resource":"image"},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"lkBLOrhTZDb2Xq7g","name":"OpenAI account"}},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"85b71014-9f64-46ab-9358-bfa69739c8c2","name":"Convert Thumbnail to Base64","type":"n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile","position":[-128,992],"parameters":{"options":{"keepSource":"both"},"operation":"binaryToPropery","destinationKey":"imageBase64"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"bfce20aa-6893-41c9-a780-af2ef02c9ba0","name":"Upload Thumbnail to Drive","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[128,992],"parameters":{"name":"={{ 'thumbnail-' + $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.contentId + '.png' }}","driveId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"My Drive"},"options":{},"folderId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.drive_parent_folder_id }}"}},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"9HcgFzu8eUpjCd07","name":"Google Drive account"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"de567fa7-0fbf-41af-be08-efbaa5f5c91e","name":"Save Draft to Google Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[368,992],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"title":"={{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.title }}","format":"={{ $('Content Request Form').item.json['Content format'] }}","status":"READY","bodyHtml":"={{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.bodyHtml }}","hashtags":"={{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.hashtags }}","bodyPlain":"={{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.bodyPlain }}","contentId":"={{ $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.contentId }}","createdAt":"={{ $json.createdTime }}","driveFileId":"={{ $json.id }}"},"schema":[{"id":"contentId","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"contentId","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"format","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"format","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"title","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"title","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"bodyPlain","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"bodyPlain","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"bodyHtml","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"bodyHtml","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"hashtags","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"hashtags","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"driveFileId","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"driveFileId","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"status","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"status","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"createdAt","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"createdAt","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":[],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.google_sheet_name }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.google_spreadsheet_id }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"H1AiFZFA9HTXOX7Z","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"ade41aad-8605-47e5-be04-fa5a46caaa0c","name":"Build Preview Page","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[576,992],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"html-page","name":"html","type":"string","value":"=<div style=\"max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;text-align:left;\">\n<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,{{ $('Convert Thumbnail to Base64').item.json.imageBase64 }}\" alt=\"AI generated thumbnail\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:12px;display:block;\" />\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 6px;\"><span style=\"background:#eef2ff;color:#4338ca;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">{{ $('Content Request Form').item.json['Content format'] }}</span> <span style=\"background:#eef2ff;color:#4338ca;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">{{ $('Content Request Form').item.json['Tone'] }}</span> <span style=\"background:#ecfdf5;color:#047857;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">Topic: {{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.chosenTopic }}</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;margin:10px 0 18px;\">{{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.title }}</h1>\n<div style=\"line-height:1.65;font-size:16px;\">{{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.bodyHtml }}</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:32px;\">Copy-ready text (select and copy)</h3>\n<pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;word-wrap:break-word;background:#f4f5f7;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">{{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.bodyPlain }}\n\n{{ $('Write the Content').item.json.message.content.hashtags }}</pre>\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px;text-align:center;\"><a href=\"{{ $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.publishWebhookUrl }}?id={{ $('⚙️ Workflow Configuration').item.json.contentId }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:{{ $('Content Request Form').item.json['Content format'] === 'LinkedIn post' ? '#0a66c2' : '#21759b' }};color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;\">{{ $('Content Request Form').item.json['Content format'] === 'LinkedIn post' ? '🚀 Post to LinkedIn' : '📝 Send to WordPress as draft' }}</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#065f46;background:#d1fae5;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin-top:18px;\">💡 Right-click the thumbnail to save it — it's embedded in this page, so it never expires. Nothing is published until you press the button{{ $('Content Request Form').item.json['Content format'] === 'LinkedIn post' ? '' : ' — and WordPress receives it as a draft for final review' }}.</p>\n</div>"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"6198317e-6df0-4a95-a4cf-27647d790e2f","name":"Show Preview to User","type":"n8n-nodes-base.form","position":[800,992],"webhookId":"7744340f-3e17-4c49-bfcf-8c3b1d33ac0d","parameters":{"operation":"completion","respondWith":"showText","responseText":"={{ $json.html }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"974dfc73-169b-40b2-94fe-7efaaa235684","name":"Publish Button Clicked","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-1088,1456],"webhookId":"e70ecd41-08f4-4f84-852b-a64f5ac0e6bc","parameters":{"path":"content-studio-publish","options":{},"responseMode":"responseNode"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"781a39da-37a6-483c-9c43-fac0f7f2d428","name":"⚙️ Publish Configuration","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[-896,1456],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"pubcfg-wp-url","name":"wordpressSiteUrl","type":"string","value":"https://YOUR_BLOG_URL.com"},{"id":"a3e1bb11-f3a2-4b87-a4ce-353d8e219d8c","name":"google_spreadsheet_id","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"abda4f45-11d3-4403-809e-55b21f1edd58","name":"google_sheet_name","type":"string","value":"posts"}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"16284c9e-5fe2-461c-be94-0b1d01666773","name":"Find Draft by ID","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[-688,1456],"parameters":{"options":{},"filtersUI":{"values":[{"lookupValue":"={{ $json.query.id }}","lookupColumn":"contentId"}]},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $json.google_sheet_name }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $json.google_spreadsheet_id }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"H1AiFZFA9HTXOX7Z","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"0dcb71ea-4fed-439c-8499-71f091808645","name":"Already Processed or Not Found?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[-496,1456],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"cond-status","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEquals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.status }}","rightValue":"READY"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"c9351493-d6b1-4bf8-b313-243958ef6f1b","name":"Respond Already Processed","type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","position":[-240,1360],"parameters":{"options":{"responseHeaders":{"entries":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/html; charset=utf-8"}]}},"respondWith":"text","responseBody":"<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:60px auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#1f2937;\"><h1 style=\"font-size:24px;\">⚠️ Nothing to publish</h1><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">This draft was either already processed or the link is invalid. Check your Google Sheet for the draft's status.</p></div>"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"dee6f53a-7259-4eb9-879c-49ded1975031","name":"Download Thumbnail from Drive","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[-256,1568],"parameters":{"fileId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $json.driveFileId }}"},"options":{},"operation":"download"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"9HcgFzu8eUpjCd07","name":"Google Drive account"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"9f151d57-3d91-4499-a7fb-e4b901c1cc11","name":"Route by Format","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[-48,1568],"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"outputKey":"LinkedIn","conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"route-linkedin","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.format }}","rightValue":"LinkedIn post"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"WordPress","conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"route-wordpress","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.format }}","rightValue":"WordPress blog post"}]},"renameOutput":true}]},"options":{}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"47064843-6621-4463-aebd-2d215f337e5c","name":"Post to LinkedIn","type":"n8n-nodes-base.linkedIn","position":[192,1472],"parameters":{"text":"={{ $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.bodyPlain }}\n\n{{ $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.hashtags }}","person":"iE391NS6_f","additionalFields":{},"shareMediaCategory":"IMAGE"},"credentials":{"linkedInOAuth2Api":{"id":"CzCaS1fM6KZoaW1w","name":"LinkedIn account"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"15d5d22d-d4c5-4aff-b371-2e9ffa21272e","name":"Upload Thumbnail to WordPress","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[192,1680],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $('⚙️ Publish Configuration').item.json.wordpressSiteUrl }}/wp-json/wp/v2/media","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"contentType":"binaryData","sendHeaders":true,"authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"Content-Disposition","value":"=attachment; filename=\"thumbnail-{{ $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.contentId }}.png\""}]},"inputDataFieldName":"data","nodeCredentialType":"wordpressApi"},"credentials":{"wordpressApi":{"id":"Xtp62159wINF55OL","name":"Wordpress account"}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"616457fb-27fc-4d6b-8ef3-6d6f84822c60","name":"Create WordPress Draft","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[400,1680],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $('⚙️ Publish Configuration').item.json.wordpressSiteUrl }}/wp-json/wp/v2/posts","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ title: $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.title, content: $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.bodyHtml, status: 'draft', featured_media: $json.id }) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"wordpressApi"},"credentials":{"wordpressApi":{"id":"Xtp62159wINF55OL","name":"Wordpress account"}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"4972c833-bfeb-4050-88f4-bd09f94e6bb2","name":"Mark Draft as Processed","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[608,1552],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"status":"PROCESSED","contentId":"={{ $('Publish Button Clicked').item.json.query.id }}"},"schema":[{"id":"contentId","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"contentId","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"format","type":"string","display":true,"removed":true,"required":false,"displayName":"format","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"title","type":"string","display":true,"removed":true,"required":false,"displayName":"title","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"bodyPlain","type":"string","display":true,"removed":true,"required":false,"displayName":"bodyPlain","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"bodyHtml","type":"string","display":true,"removed":true,"required":false,"displayName":"bodyHtml","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"hashtags","type":"string","display":true,"removed":true,"required":false,"displayName":"hashtags","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"driveFileId","type":"string","display":true,"removed":true,"required":false,"displayName":"driveFileId","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"status","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"status","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"createdAt","type":"string","display":true,"removed":true,"required":false,"displayName":"createdAt","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":["contentId"],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"appendOrUpdate","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('⚙️ Publish Configuration').item.json.google_sheet_name }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('⚙️ Publish Configuration').item.json.google_spreadsheet_id }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"H1AiFZFA9HTXOX7Z","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"c3fd8a2f-90b7-4cd1-9797-926107cd42b2","name":"Respond Publish Success","type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","position":[784,1552],"parameters":{"options":{"responseHeaders":{"entries":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/html; charset=utf-8"}]}},"respondWith":"text","responseBody":"=<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:60px auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#1f2937;\"><h1 style=\"font-size:26px;\">{{ $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.format === 'LinkedIn post' ? '🎉 Posted to LinkedIn!' : '📝 Draft created in WordPress!' }}</h1><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">{{ $('Find Draft by ID').item.json.format === 'LinkedIn post' ? 'Your post and thumbnail are live on LinkedIn.' : 'Your blog post is waiting in WordPress as a draft, with the thumbnail set as its featured image. Log in to WordPress to review and publish.' }} This draft is now marked as processed — pressing the button again won't duplicate it.</p></div>"},"typeVersion":1.1}],"active":false,"pinData":{"Write the Content":[{"json":{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":{"title":"Harnessing the Power of Generative AI: A Game Changer for Businesses","bodyHtml":"<p><strong>The landscape of business technology is evolving, and generative AI is at the forefront of this transformation.</strong> As companies of all sizes are discovering, leveraging the capabilities of generative AI can enhance creativity, streamline processes, and foster innovation.</p><p>Generative AI tools, such as OpenAI's ChatGPT or DALL-E, are enabling businesses to produce content, design graphics, and even analyze data with unprecedented efficiency. Imagine a marketing team using AI-generated drafts to brainstorm campaigns, or a product team utilizing AI to create prototypes faster than ever.</p><p>However, with this rapid advancement comes responsibility. Businesses must navigate ethical considerations, such as data privacy and AI transparency. Integrating generative AI isn't just about technology—it's about ensuring these tools align with our values and societal norms.</p><p>As leaders, we have the power to shape how generative AI is utilized. Are we ready to embrace this trend and redefine our operational strategies? What innovative ways can we implement generative AI in our organizations?</p><p>Join the conversation on this pivotal topic!</p>","hashtags":"#GenerativeAI #BusinessInnovation #AIethics #DigitalTransformation #TechnologyTrends","bodyPlain":"The landscape of business technology is evolving, and generative AI is at the forefront of this transformation. As companies of all sizes are discovering, leveraging the capabilities of generative AI can enhance creativity, streamline processes, and foster innovation.\n\nGenerative AI tools, such as OpenAI's ChatGPT or DALL-E, are enabling businesses to produce content, design graphics, and even analyze data with unprecedented efficiency. Imagine a marketing team using AI-generated drafts to brainstorm campaigns, or a product team utilizing AI to create prototypes faster than ever.\n\nHowever, with this rapid advancement comes responsibility. Businesses must navigate ethical considerations, such as data privacy and AI transparency. Integrating generative AI isn't just about technology—it's about ensuring these tools align with our values and societal norms.\n\nAs leaders, we have the power to shape how generative AI is utilized. Are we ready to embrace this trend and redefine our operational strategies? What innovative ways can we implement generative AI in our organizations?\n\nJoin the conversation on this pivotal topic!","chosenTopic":"The Rise of Generative AI in Business","thumbnailPrompt":"a professional image depicting a futuristic office space with AI elements, such as abstract representations of data streams and AI models, in a 16:9 composition, no text or lettering"},"refusal":null,"annotations":[]},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"},"pairedItem":{"item":0}}],"Create Thumbnail Image":[{"json":{"id":"filesystem-v2:workflows/84JXgG9Ic9QCAX67/executions/391/binary_data/68dbfdd4-ab13-446e-b0ed-c7a3033a43f9","bytes":2459999,"fileName":"data","fileSize":"2.46 MB","fileType":"image","mimeType":"image/png","fileExtension":"png"},"binary":{"data":{"id":"filesystem-v2:workflows/84JXgG9Ic9QCAX67/executions/391/binary_data/68dbfdd4-ab13-446e-b0ed-c7a3033a43f9","data":"filesystem-v2","bytes":2459999,"fileName":"data","fileSize":"2.46 MB","fileType":"image","mimeType":"image/png","fileExtension":"png"}},"pairedItem":{"item":0}}]},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","availableInMCP":false,"executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"a25d1879-109f-4d99-a5ac-718a9c930865","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Route by Format":{"main":[[{"node":"Post to LinkedIn","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Upload Thumbnail to WordPress","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Find Draft by ID":{"main":[[{"node":"Already Processed or Not Found?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Post to LinkedIn":{"main":[[{"node":"Mark Draft as Processed","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Write the Content":{"main":[[{"node":"Create Thumbnail Image","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build Preview Page":{"main":[[{"node":"Show Preview to User","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Content Request Form":{"main":[[{"node":"⚙️ Workflow Configuration","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Create Thumbnail Image":{"main":[[{"node":"Convert Thumbnail to Base64","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Create WordPress Draft":{"main":[[{"node":"Mark Draft as Processed","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Publish Button Clicked":{"main":[[{"node":"⚙️ Publish Configuration","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Mark Draft as Processed":{"main":[[{"node":"Respond Publish Success","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Upload Thumbnail to Drive":{"main":[[{"node":"Save Draft to Google Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Convert Thumbnail to Base64":{"main":[[{"node":"Upload Thumbnail to Drive","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Save Draft to Google Sheets":{"main":[[{"node":"Build Preview Page","type":"main","index":0}]